Yeah.

00:18:04.870 --> 00:18:08.580
This is how the attack against the Haurin village began.

00:18:09.710 --> 00:18:21.120
It's a souvenir, but actually, I didn't know the meaning of a souvenir last night.

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:24.420
Our village didn't have that kind of custom.

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:27.790
No, don't worry about it.

00:18:27.990 --> 00:18:29.840
Next time, I'll be sure to...

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:36.080
Our village is poor, so we can't bring much, but...

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:40.390
No, in the first place, a souvenir is a feeling that is not a good thing.

00:18:41.110 --> 00:18:45.380
It makes me feel better when you say that.

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:50.980
After a while, the day came to participate in the position of the village.

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:54.920
I was going to participate, but...

00:18:55.160 --> 00:18:57.500
No, if the top suddenly goes, I'll be able to see my feet.

00:18:58.600 --> 00:18:59.410
Is that so?

00:19:00.220 --> 00:19:03.670
That's how it is. As a result of the lottery, I will be in charge of the village head.

00:19:06.010 --> 00:19:12.710
At first, it was scheduled to take 10 days to move, but Doraem was able to bring everyone with a bottle of wine as a reward.

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:20.180
Since the first visit, Doraem has been coming to play a lot.

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:29.130
Every time, he brings jewels and weapons as souvenirs, so everyone doesn't say anything.

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:35.760
Delivering a bottle of wine was a proposal from Doraem, so I accepted it.

00:19:36.220 --> 00:19:38.320
Well then, let's go!

00:19:38.800 --> 00:19:40.620
Nice to meet you!

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:41.180
Ah!

00:19:42.370 --> 00:19:51.150
Is he really coming?

00:19:52.310 --> 00:19:53.350
Galf has started a trade.

00:19:54.570 --> 00:19:55.720
He's coming.

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:58.150
I haven't heard from him that he's in the mountains yet.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:09.320
Hey, look at that!

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:15.150
How was it?

00:20:15.880 --> 00:20:19.810
I was able to exchange all of them, and all of them were well-received.

00:20:20.050 --> 00:20:28.230
At first, I didn't know if I was holding back, but I was able to do what the village head was talking about, which was selling food.

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:28.850
I'm going to do a tasting sale.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.660
As soon as I arrived, people gathered in a blink of an eye.

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:35.760
Even the wine I was looking for was sold out.

00:20:36.440 --> 00:20:37.150
I see.

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:38.360
All right.

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:40.440
Drink plenty of it for dinner tonight.

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:42.240
As expected of the village head.

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:42.640
I know how to behave.

00:20:43.940 --> 00:20:48.500
Also, the village head of Haulin Village is confident that a few people can move in here.

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:53.980
I want more people, and I welcome the move.

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:56.850
There are about 20 people who want to move in.

00:20:57.130 --> 00:20:59.110
It's all young women.

00:20:59.110 --> 00:20:59.850
生徒のことです。

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:06.240
In fact, there are very few men in this village right now.

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:09.440
At this rate, the future of the village will be very uncertain.

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:12.190
Okay, let's make a condition.

00:21:12.550 --> 00:21:17.030
If at least two young men join us, everyone will be accepted.

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:17.710
Certainly.

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:21.560
With this, the future of the village will be safe.

00:21:21.980 --> 00:21:29.220
Then, please accept the transfer.

00:21:31.470 --> 00:21:36.640
I came here with the resolve to endure it. Please don't abandon me.

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:43.540
Ah, I'm sorry to make you so desperate, but I've prepared a place to sleep.

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:46.250
Please live there for a while.

00:21:46.290 --> 00:21:47.980
For a while?

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:52.620
Yeah, if you get used to living here, I'll ask for a house like this.

00:21:53.780 --> 00:21:56.160
Don't worry, I won't kick you out.

00:22:01.240 --> 00:22:04.260
Ah, by the way, where's the man who just moved in?

00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:05.060
Yes!

00:22:06.180 --> 00:22:16.970
Oh, no, wait a minute.

00:22:17.090 --> 00:22:19.250
5 years later, 10 years later, it would be better.

00:22:19.550 --> 00:22:23.080
What is it? The future of the Taiji village!

00:24:04.284 --> 00:24:06.284
Thanks for watching!
